<title>USA: N.E. Johnson Cty CFD 2, Kan., won by George Baum.</title>
<headline>N.E. Johnson Cty CFD 2, Kan., won by George Baum.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>George K. Baum said it won $2.500 million of Northeast Consolidated Fire Dist. No. 2, Kan., general obligation bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.14 percent.</p>
</text>
